OL,3,GNEWSALong-lost Chevalier landscape     
OL,4,Afound in charity shop                  
OL,6,FA rediscovered 19th Century oil        
OL,7,Fpainting bought for #20 in a charity   
OL,8,Fshop could be auctioned for up to      
OL,9,F#20,000.                               
OL,11,FCape Schanck, Victoria, by             
OL,12,FRussian-Swiss artist Nicholas          
OL,13,FChevalier, was discovered in a charity 
OL,14,Fshop in Maidenhead, Berkshire.         
OL,16,FIt was brought to the attention of     
OL,17,FAdrian Biddell at London's Olympia     
OL,18,FAuctions, who established the painting 
OL,19,Fwas a Chevalier work that had been     
OL,20,Fmissing for 160 years.                 
